RtcOffer.description:
Client SDP offer. The client must create the `auoreo-events` data channel first.

F1: offer an audio m-line (`sendrecv`, or `recvonly` to only listen) to hear the agent;
`input: true` additionally accepts an `auoreo-input` data channel (teleop).

post.description:
MCP-style POST-SSE mirror of the GET replay (spec §25.12): the tail (after `after_seq`,
else the most recent `limit` events) streamed as SSE and closed by a `[DONE]` sentinel;
`Accept: application/json` (without `text/event-stream`) gets the `EventsTail` snapshot.
